@startuml
title Architecture 6: AI Gateway & Telemetry
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #1F4E79
}

actor "Application Services" as Apps

package "AI Gateway (Cross-Cutting Controls)" {
  rectangle "Auth & Token Budgeting\n(Max 8k Tokens / Request)" as Budget
  rectangle "Rate Limiter\n(Max 20/hr per Rider)" as RateLimit
  rectangle "Model Router" as Router
}

package "External Models" {
  cloud "Free-Tier LLM API" as ExternalLLM
}

package "Observability & Audit Layer" {
  database "AI Trace DB (90-Day Retention)" as TraceDB
  rectangle "Trace Assembler\n(Context, Latency, Tools)" as TraceSvc
}

Apps --> RateLimit : AI Request
RateLimit --> Budget : Pass if < 20/hr
Budget --> Router : Allocate Tokens

Router --> ExternalLLM : Model Invocation

ExternalLLM --> TraceSvc : Raw Response & Metadata
Router --> TraceSvc : Routing & Timeout Metrics

TraceSvc --> TraceDB : Log: Pseudonymous ID, Latency, Tools, Outcome
TraceSvc --> Apps : Validated Response
@enduml